                 |   Service Load       |
                 |      Balancer        |
                 +----------+-----------+
                            |
              +-------------+-------------+
              |             |             |
              v             v             v
         +---------+   +---------+   +---------+
         | Service |   | Service |   | Service |
         | Instance|   | Instance|   | Instance|
