# QUESTION: HOT KEY KYA HOTA HAI?
==================================

Hot Key ek aisi cache key hoti hai jiske liye normal keys ke comparison me disproportionately zyada requests aati hain 
yaani ek particular key ke around extremely high traffic concentrate ho jaata hai.

----------------------------------------------
## QUESTION: HOT KEY SE PROBLEM KYA HOTI HAI?
----------------------------------------------

Redis Cluster me different keys different nodes pe store hoti hain. Ab agar koi key — jo Node 1 pe stored hai — suddenly viral ho jaye (jaise 1M req/sec), 
to saari traffic Node 1 pe concentrate ho jaayegi, jabki cluster ki baaki nodes khaali baithe hongi. Isse wo node overloaded ho jaata hai — latency badhti 
hai aur performance degrade hoti hai. Yaani overall cluster ke paas enough capacity available hoti hai, lekin traffic evenly distributed nahi hota.

